      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is profoundly difficult when your moral compass clashes with the harsh realities of financial instability and social exclusion. Your frustration is completely valid because the systems we live in often fail to reward ethical behavior. Instead of viewing the \"game\" as one you must win on their terms, consider finding smaller, personal arenas where your values can still shape your reality. Focusing on rebuilding your life and finding a community that shares your integrity can provide a necessary foundation outside of that toxic professional structure.",
      "source": "target",
